From: AliGram <aligram@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:09:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/67] =?UTF-8?q?feat(aligram):=20preservation=20UI=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20chat=20toggle,=20settings=20row,=20render=20guard,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20About?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ChatActivity: 'Preserve media' header-menu item (groups/channels,
next to View Deleted) opening a dialog with the per-chat state
(ON/OFF, PENDING activation notice), preserved-items stats loaded on
a background thread, enable/disable toggle and per-chat clear.
NekoExperimentalSettingsActivity: AliGram preserved-media row in the
Ayu section (enabled chats + stored size, refreshed async) with a
confirmed clear-all action that keeps per-chat opt-ins
(clearPreservedStorage).
H-R render guard: AyuMessageHistory prefers the preserved blob for a
revision; AyuViewDeleted plays a deleted message from its blob when
one exists (R-07 fallback). Both are UI-safe map lookups, never DAO.
NekoAboutActivity: AliGram row with the based-on-NagramX statement,
feature summary and GPLv3 notice.
New strings in strings_nax.xml. Controller additions:
clearPreservedStorage, getPreservedStatsForDialog, per-account
getPreservedStats (was global), getUnreferencedBlobs sweep (purge and
clear now drop orphaned blob rows promptly).
